- Configured local environment for Unified Memory Architecture (UMA) via ttm.pages_limit
- Integrated vLLM ROCm container into docker-compose for high-throughput inference
- Added VllmRocmGateway to dynamically route to local vLLM instances
- Added DeepSeek-R1 (70B) to the model registry as the Tier 1 Orchestrator

